msgctxt "Description"
msgid "Animates display transformations"
msgstr "Animasikan transformasi tampilan display"

#: src/effects/sessionquit/package/metadata.json
msgctxt "Description"
msgid "Keep the desktop background alive during logout until the end"
msgstr ""
"Jaga latar belakang desktop tetap nyala selama keluar log sampai selesai"

#: src/effects/sheet/metadata.json
msgctxt "Description"
msgid ""
"Make modal dialogs smoothly fly in and out when they are shown or hidden"
msgstr ""
"Buat secara halus sosok dialog terbang ketika ia ditampilkan atau "
"disembunyikan"

